# The Legend of Yangchen, chapter I: "Starting with you, each player chooses up to one permanent with mana value 3 or greater
# from among permanents your opponents control. Exile those permanents." Bot2 controls the only permanents your opponents
# control: Alert Shu Infantry and Bender's Waterskin (mana value 3 each) and five Mox Pearls (mana value 0). Bot1 chooses first
# and Bot2 second, and each may choose only one of the two: a Mox Pearl (too cheap), the Saga itself (Bot1's own, and Bot2 chooses
# among permanents Bot1's opponents control, which Bot1's are not) and two at once are all refused. Bot1 takes the Infantry and
# Bot2 its own Waterskin, so both go to exile; Bot2's Moxen and the Plains stay.

